The function prototype is as follows. When the program executed WRITE\_REG(FLASH->OPTKEYR, FLASH\_OPTKEY1), HardFault\_Handler interrupt was triggered.At this moment, R13(SP) = 0x200BFF40, R14(LR) = 0xFFFFFFA8, R15(PC) = 0x08008250。I have identified the cause. The ICACHE needs to be disabled.

```

HAL_StatusTypeDef HAL_FLASH_OB_Unlock(void)

{

if (READ_BIT(FLASH->NSCR, FLASH_NSCR_OPTLOCK) != 0U)

{

/* Authorizes the Option Byte register programming */

WRITE_REG(FLASH->OPTKEYR, FLASH_OPTKEY1);

WRITE_REG(FLASH->OPTKEYR, FLASH_OPTKEY2);

/* Verify that the Option Bytes are unlocked */

if (READ_BIT(FLASH->NSCR, FLASH_NSCR_OPTLOCK) != 0U)

{

return HAL_ERROR;

}

}

return HAL_OK;

}

```

