When I was developing the stm32u575, I needed to set the threshold for the bor (power-on reset). I wanted the device to reset when the voltage was below a certain level. While configuring the bor threshold for the stm32u575, I followed the configuration process of the stm32f405, but it didn't work. The program got stuck at HAL\_FLASH\_OB\_Unlock(). Why did this happen? What was the problem?

```

FLASH_OBProgramInitTypeDef OBInit;

HAL_FLASHEx_OBGetConfig(&OBInit);

OBInit.USERType = OB_USER_BOR_LEV;

OBInit.USERConfig = OB_BOR_LEVEL_1;

HAL_FLASH_OB_Unlock();

HAL_FLASHEx_OBProgram(&OBInit);

HAL_FLASH_OB_Launch();

HAL_FLASH_OB_Lock();

```
